iver market, InnoLight alone ~27% (Counterpoint). A US import ban on new models would forcibly re-route that demand to COHR, LITE, AAOI, FN, CIEN, NOK, MTSI, SMTC \u2014 but the Foundation for American Innovation notes the Western vendors lack the SCALE to replace Chinese supply quickly, so the near-term effect is pricing power and shortage, not clean substitution. Mirror-image risk for 300308.SZ and 300502.SZ. Still drafting \u2014 could be modified or shelved.","hits":"opt, net"}]}